@startuml VMS_TripState
!theme plain
title Vehicle Management System - Trip State Diagram

[*] --> SCHEDULED

SCHEDULED --> IN_PROGRESS: Start trip
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED: Complete trip
IN_PROGRESS --> CANCELLED: Trip cancelled
SCHEDULED --> CANCELLED: Trip cancelled before start
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of SCHEDULED
  Trip is scheduled and waiting
  to start
end note

note right of IN_PROGRESS
  Trip is currently active
  driver is on route
end note

note right of COMPLETED
  Trip has been completed
  successfully
end note

note right of CANCELLED
  Trip has been cancelled
  for any reason
end note

@enduml
